Shopkeepers are present in every {{r|Shop}} and most {{r|Secret Room}}s, and can also be found in {{r|Vault}}s, {{r|Arcade}}s, [[Bedroom]]s, and {{r|I AM ERROR}} rooms. They cannot be hit by normal attacks, but explosions and certain items will damage them. Occasionally, destroying them will yield rewards.

Destroying a shopkeeper increases the chance for a {{r|Devil Room}} or {{r|Angel Room}} to appear by 10% for the current floor.

